EO and Co-Founder, Winnie', 'reshared_post_description': 'I posted a month ago about having trouble getting press for a big launch we had coming up of Winnie\'s K-12 school search. Based on the advice of many of you, we decided to shift gears and instead just use channels we had available to get the message out. I’m now convinced that the days of holding news for the press are over.\n\nHere are some of the ways we got the word out: We submitted a Forbes article related to the launch, I went on the Edtech Insiders podcast, and we announced the news on our own blog and social media channels (including this one right here!). We asked some folks that had email lists and audiences to rebroadcast our news. Soon we’ll be sending out emails to our own audience promoting the expansion to K-12.\n\nSo far it’s been working just as well as any "official press" would have…\n- On a parenting panel I was on recently, one of the participants said she saw our K-12 news on LinkedIn\n- On a customer call, one of our customers mentioned she had read my piece in Forbes\xa0\n- Our landing page for the launch got 1500 page views with no paid marketing\n\nWe didn’t worry about making one big splash and instead just put the product out there and started talking about it. I’m convinced that\'s the way. So check out what we’ve built so far at https://lnkd.in/gTkJKvc8 and stay tuned for lots more to come.', 'reshared_post_followers': None, 'reshared_post_date': '2d', 'last_updated': '2025-05-13 22:17:46', 'deleted': 1}, {'id': 1021138591, 'company_id': 9752392, 'urn': 'urn:li:activity:7312524815859339265', 'followers': 2989, 'date': '2w', 'description': '🚨 Big news! Winnie is expanding beyond early education — we’re officially launching a K-12 school search: https://lnkd.in/gTJavUxs\n\nWe’re bringing our trusted platform to help families discover all their education options, from preschool through high school.\n\nGet the full scoop on our expansion into K-12 on the latest episode of\xa0Edtech 