ared_post_author': 'Alexa Trippensee', 'reshared_post_author_url': 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/alexatrippensee', 'reshared_post_author_headline': 'Education Leader - Talent Developer - Process Optimization Enthusiast', 'reshared_post_description': 'What an honor it was to have the pleasure of meeting Annie Trevino finally in person from Winnie !!! We had such a great time touring our BB Country Day School in Pompano Beach, FL and discussing how we will grow together in the future! Thank you for visiting us! We are so thankful for Winnie and Annie’s partnership for our schools.', 'reshared_post_followers': None, 'reshared_post_date': '3w', 'last_updated': '2025-08-10 15:19:36', 'deleted': 0}, {'id': 1228003892, 'company_id': 9752392, 'urn': 'urn:li:activity:7336814781602926595', 'followers': 834, 'date': '2mo', 'description': "Whole industries are being transformed by AI. While it's true that the #Earlychildhoodeducation field will likely look different as a result of this technology, AI will never be able to replace #ECE professionals. Check out this insightful exploration of the unique importance of educators in the #childcare space by Winnie: https://bit.ly/4d2HIbx", 'reactions_count': 4, 'comments_count': None, 'reshared_post_author': None, 'reshared_post_author_url': None, 'reshared_post_author_headline': None, 'reshared_post_description': None, 'reshared_post_followers': None, 'reshared_post_date': None, 'last_updated': '2025-08-10 15:19:36', 'deleted': 0}, {'id': 1228003894, 'company_id': 9752392, 'urn': 'urn:li:activity:7318996802345517056', 'followers': 3609, 'date': '3mo', 'description': 'Behind the scenes of our expansion to K-12 school search 👀', 'reactions_count': 11, 'comments_count': None, 'reshared_post_author': 'Sara Mauskopf', 'reshared_post_author_url': 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/smausk', 'reshared_post_author_headline': 'CEO and Co-Founder, Winnie', 'reshared_post_description': 'I posted a month ago about having trouble getting press for a big 